      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 6,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "养肝／疏肝解郁",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00274",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[6].cells[0].content[2]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 24679,
      "endIndex": 24718,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 6,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "Nature’s Green 绿叶\u000bMind Soothe Capsules",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00275",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[6].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 24719,
      "endIndex": 24806,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 6,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "Ingredient examples: [Chai Hu](https://herbaltcm.sn.polyu.edu.hk/herbal/chinese-thorowax-root) bitter, slightly cold; [Suan Zao Ren](https://herbaltcm.sn.polyu.edu.hk/herbal/spine-date-seed) sweet, sour, neutral.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00276",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[6].cells[2].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 24807,
      "endIndex": 24877,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 6,
        "columnIndex": 2
      },
      "text": "[Chai Hu](https://herbaltcm.sn.polyu.edu.hk/herbal/chinese-thorowax-root): Liver, Gallbladder. [Suan Zao Ren](https://herbaltcm.sn.polyu.edu.hk/herbal/spine-date-seed): Liver, Gallbladder, Heart.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00277",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[6].cells[3].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 24878,
      "endIndex": 24974,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 6,
        "columnIndex": 3
      },
      "text": "Staff described Liver nourishment and soothing constraint; the box uses “Mind Soothe” language.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00278",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[6].cells[4].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 24975,
      "endIndex": 25029,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 6,
        "columnIndex": 4
      },
      "text": "Staff linked this category to late nights and stress.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00279",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[7].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25031,
      "endIndex": 25033,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 7,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.g72xz52rfkll]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00280",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[7].cells[0].content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25033,
      "endIndex": 25060,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 7,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "银翘类\u000bYin Qiao-type remedies",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00281",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[7].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25061,
      "endIndex": 25097,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 7,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "Reference [honeysuckle](https://herbaltcm.sn.polyu.edu.hk/herbal/japanese-honeysuckle-flower): sweet; cold.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00282",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[7].cells[2].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25098,
      "endIndex": 25143,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 7,
        "columnIndex": 2
      },
      "text": "Reference [honeysuckle](https://herbaltcm.sn.polyu.edu.hk/herbal/japanese-honeysuckle-flower): Lung, Heart, Stomach.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00283",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[7].cells[3].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25144,
      "endIndex": 25195,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 7,
        "columnIndex": 3
      },
      "text": "Staff associated this category with cold symptoms.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00284",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[7].cells[4].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25196,
      "endIndex": 25235,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 7,
        "columnIndex": 4
      },
      "text": "Staff described use for cold symptoms.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00285",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[8].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25237,
      "endIndex": 25239,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 8,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.yelwjm1hfjdk]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00286",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[8].cells[0].content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25239,
      "endIndex": 25262,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 8,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "红花油／红油精\u000bMedicated oils",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00287",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[8].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25263,
      "endIndex": 25365,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 8,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "[Fei Fah](https://feifah.com/products/red-flower-ointment-50ml) example: described as a warming topical liniment; oral flavour classification does not apply.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00288",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[8].cells[2].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25366,
      "endIndex": 25438,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 8,
        "columnIndex": 2
      },
      "text": "Applied locally; the manufacturer does not specify a meridian affinity.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00289",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[8].cells[3].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25439,
      "endIndex": 25486,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 8,
        "columnIndex": 3
      },
      "text": "Staff associated oils with aches and injuries.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00290",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[135].table.rows[8].cells[4].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25487,
      "endIndex": 25547,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 23410,
        "rowIndex": 8,
        "columnIndex": 4
      },
      "text": "Staff described external use, including by older customers.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00291",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[136]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25548,
      "endIndex": 25785,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Sources (text): staff interview; The Hong Kong Polytechnic University (n.d.-a, n.d.-e, n.d.-f, n.d.-g, n.d.-h, n.d.-i, n.d.-j, n.d.-l, n.d.-n); Fei Fah (n.d.). Herb profiles describe reference ingredients, not complete product formulas.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
